	(text "* SNAC on HDMI\nPin: FPGA Pin\n 1 : AH9\n 2 : AG11\n 3 : AF15\n 4 : AH11\n 5 : AH12\n 6 : AG16\n 7 : AF17\n 8 : AD4\n\n* I2S for Line Out\nNet : FPGA Pin\nDIN : AC4\nLRCK: AG8\nBCK : AG10\n~{MUTE}: AH8\n\n* SliRP UART\nNet : FPGA Pin\nRXD : U9\nTXD : V10\n\n* I2C Controller\nNet : FPGA Pin\nSDA : AG9\nSCK : U14"
		(exclude_from_sim yes)
		(at 45.466 99.568 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "603c5440-2373-4cec-93c7-a801257f7103")
	)
	(text "ESP32/EC Functions and pin assignments\n* Boot strap (flash): IO0@i, EN@i, U0RXD@i, U0TXD@o\n* TCPC\n  * Negotiate SINK 5V@3A + 4-lane DP Alt Mode\n* I2C Controller: IO21/SDA, IO38/SCL\n* DVI-A/VGA output:\n  * Red[0,1] = [IO10,IO11]@o3v3\n  * Green[0,1] = [IO45,IO40]@o3v3\n  * Blue[0,1] = [IO46,IO39]@o3v3\n  * HSYNC = IO47@o1v8\n  * VSYNC = IO48@o1v8\n* DDR\n  * Power Good: IO2@o3v3\n  * I2C same pin as controller\n* WiFi SLiRP modem, UART1\n  * TxD: U1TXD@o3v3\n  * RxD: U1RXD@i3v3\n* KVM\n  * User Switch: IO3@i falling edge\n  * Port selection: IO5@o3v3, L=USBC DP, H=FPGA DP\n* FPGA\n  * Temp sensor interupt alaram IO4@i falling edge\n  * Cooling Fan: SENS=IO7@i, PWM=IO8@o3v3\n  * I2C peripheral: IO41/SCL, IO42/SDA\nExpansion port:\n  * ADC1_CH8\nA500 Keyboard:\n  * CLK=IO12@o3v3\n  * DATA=IO13@i3v3\n  * RST=IO14@o3v3\n  * LED STATUS=IO15@o3v3\n  * LED INUSE=IO16@o3v3\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 97.282 91.186 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(thickness 0.2223)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "70f3a7af-7562-4447-b31c-b1e17084e7f8")
	)
